    "Verify retained capture bytes and hashes, receipt status and by-hash/by-number canonical block witnesses.",
    "Decode historical handleOps tuple, require canonical full re-encoding and exactly one operation.",
    "Decode one executeBatch call with canonical ABI prefix; retain all29trailing bytes uninterpreted.",
    "Decode the nested bond with previously authenticated purchase ABI; require one zero-native-value DTF purchase to the recorded NFT recipient.",
    "Recompute the UserOperation hash including full callData and match the successful event sender/nonce/hash.",
    "Match one DTF debit from smart account to weighted DETF, no DTF refund or WETH wallet transfer in the receipt, and one NFT mint between payment and operation completion."
  ],
